{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve hand-crafted puzzles across multiple mechanics: from single-solution challenges and word-based doors, to strategy levels with companion robots, diamond-collecting mazes, and cryptic clue-based conundrums.<br> <br>Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creative, rewarding word-based puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in dictionary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional clue system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Challenging words' hidden among levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing original guitar soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-bindable keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full or windowed (fully resizable) play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended English level: fluent, or alternatively intermediate, in which case the built-in dictionary and clue system will help you progress and improve your vocabulary as you play.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the main challenge is word-based, there\u2019s a moderately increasing Sokoban (block-pushing) element as the game progresses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330410?t=1761921998","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3330410?t=1761921998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330410/030a6870c83edd7f373e48c775fa7e012382c337/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761921998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330410/030a6870c83edd7f373e48c775fa7e012382c337/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761921998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"con